- [0-49]: 42, 33, 49, 15, 38 = 5
- [50-74]: 67, 55, 72, 63, 50 = 5
- [75-100]: 85, 91, 78, 100, 88, 76 = 6
- Suma: 5+5+6 = 16 (zgadza sie z iloscia danych)
